{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Gauss曲率"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Gauss 曲率"},2]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Gauss 曲率是 $2$ 维 Riemann 流形上的一个不变量.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n"}}